# Bloodstream Unreal Engine repository hygiene

# Unreal generated output
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Packaged/staged output
BuildOutput/
StagedBuilds/

# IDE/editor generated files
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.code-workspace
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# Build/compiler artifacts
*.o
*.obj
*.pch
*.gch
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.lib
*.a
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# OS/user files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.user
*.userprefs

# Local environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Unreal built map data is generated and must not be source authority.
*_BuiltData.uasset
